These files are model outputs and statistics. They contain no dataset
annotations. They were produced with models trained on the datasets below, and
use of those datasets is governed by their own licences. Obtain the datasets
from the official sources.

  CSL-Daily: research-only agreement with USTC.
    https://ustc-slr.github.io/datasets/2021_csl_daily/
  RWTH-PHOENIX-Weather 2014: non-commercial.
    https://www-i6.informatik.rwth-aachen.de/~koller/RWTH-PHOENIX/
  RWTH-PHOENIX-Weather 2014 T: non-commercial.
    https://www-i6.informatik.rwth-aachen.de/~koller/RWTH-PHOENIX-2014-T/
